{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1004_p", "source_sha256": "510841bbd9f48aa7e029683e87c290a9f12ba5db78c8ca10d40fc17bf6f2e1c1", "ja": "確かに。そういうところが、\n歩にピッタリの役だったってわけだ。", "zh": "确实。正因为这样，\n才说这个角色非常适合步嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1005_034ayu", "source_sha256": "bb82543efdf3bca2fccb24d27694e065f3f4affde1443107fdde068465c8326f", "ja": "えっ！？　いや、ピッタリってことはないでしょ。\n現実のアタシって、ちょいちょいカッコ悪いし……。", "zh": "诶！？不对，哪能说是完全合适啊。\n现实中的我，偶尔也挺逊的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1006_034ayu", "source_sha256": "88c5c1ecb345bdb20ef00315e344efa421201a0d7e2cfb932e21458bb9d62735", "ja": "怖がりだし、高い所もダメだし……うぅ。\n自分で言ってて悲しくなってきた。マイガー！", "zh": "胆子小，又恐高……呜呜。\n自己说出来都觉得难过了。My God！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b70335108bcdd80d55c3e061e7fc38b4dcc479828eeb265786be9fa31b7ef974", "ja": "はは。そういうところは確かにあるかもしれないけど。\nでも、歩をカッコ悪いと思った事はないな。", "zh": "哈哈。那些方面确实可能是这样。\n不过，我从没觉得步不帅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d5b6e13ca62fd9845818b7e773d0446cbd12649b21d9629fa02235ea93e88ae3", "ja": "決める時は決める！　って、カッコいいと思うよ。\nほら、今日だって一発OKだったわけだし。", "zh": "该果断的时候就果断，我觉得这样很帅哦。\n你看，今天不也是一次就通过了吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1009_034ayu", "source_sha256": "93aa7ad72c93d8fd553727bee4f3167e618f3dc280f40b68b959003c809fab34", "ja": "そ、そうかな、えへへ……♪\nまあ、そういうことなら、任せてよ！", "zh": "是、是这样吗，嘿嘿……♪\n不过，既然你都这么说了，就交给我吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_034ayu0282_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_034ayu0282_1010_034ayu", "source_sha256": "173d96fcaed62fe73cdbaf79f6c1e5ab1a26bf6aae3005a586d2f479f6f853a9", "ja": "ずっとは無理だけど、たまになら、いいトコ\n見せるから。あ、ほんと、たまにだからね！　たまに！", "zh": "虽然没法一直做到，但偶尔我也会让你见识一下我的厉害。啊，真的只是偶尔哦！偶尔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
